  "title": "fix(claude): honor provider environment for session forks",
  "body": "## Problem\nUI homePath reaches Claude subprocesses and the history worker, but direct parent SDK forkSession and fallback child-launch lookup ignore that environment. Repro: set a custom Claude config directory only in provider UI (no server env), create a session, then fork it: SDK reports session not found. This affects scoped native-Claude history generally, not just alternate binaries.\n\n## Fix\nReuse the existing isolated history worker for both SDK filesystem calls with the resolved provider environment; retain cwd/checkpoint and cancellation/error handling. No global process.env mutation, directory copying, default ~/.claude changes, or dependency changes.\n\n## Verification\n- On official-2644 source baseline 737993303: 133 focused tests and server typecheck passed. Unchanged official binary reproduced the failure.\n- UI-only diagnostic npm/web build on that baseline: actual fork/continuation, rollback and reload/reopen passed; ordinary-Claude fixture unchanged. Modified-host evidence, not an official release or full acceptance.\n- Clean cherry-pick onto main eac52f008: identical patch; refreshed frozen-lockfile dependencies, 133 focused tests, server typecheck and format check passed again. UI diagnostic was NOT rerun on this head; desktop/SEA remain unproven.\n",
  "url": "https://github.com/pingdotgg/t3code/compare/main...tnfssc:t3code:fix/claude-provider-history-env?expand=1&title=fix(claude)%3A%20honor%20provider%20environment%20for%20session%20forks&body=%23%23%20Problem%0AUI%20homePath%20reaches%20Claude%20subprocesses%20and%20the%20history%20worker%2C%20but%20direct%20parent%20SDK%20forkSession%20and%20fallback%20child-launch%20lookup%20ignore%20that%20environment.%20Repro%3A%20set%20a%20custom%20Claude%20config%20directory%20only%20in%20provider%20UI%20(no%20server%20env)%2C%20create%20a%20session%2C%20then%20fork%20it%3A%20SDK%20reports%20session%20not%20found.%20This%20affects%20scoped%20native-Claude%20history%20generally%2C%20not%20just%20alternate%20binaries.%0A%0A%23%23%20Fix%0AReuse%20the%20existing%20isolated%20history%20worker%20for%20both%20SDK%20filesystem%20calls%20with%20the%20resolved%20provider%20environment%3B%20retain%20cwd%2Fcheckpoint%20and%20cancellation%2Ferror%20handling.%20No%20global%20process.env%20mutation%2C%20directory%20copying%2C%20default%20~%2F.claude%20changes%2C%20or%20dependency%20changes.%0A%0A%23%23%20Verification%0A-%20On%20official-2644%20source%20baseline%20737993303%3A%20133%20focused%20tests%20and%20server%20typecheck%20passed.%20Unchanged%20official%20binary%20reproduced%20the%20failure.%0A-%20UI-only%20diagnostic%20npm%2Fweb%20build%20on%20that%20baseline%3A%20actual%20fork%2Fcontinuation%2C%20rollback%20and%20reload%2Freopen%20passed%3B%20ordinary-Claude%20fixture%20unchanged.%20Modified-host%20evidence%2C%20not%20an%20official%20release%20or%20full%20acceptance.%0A-%20Clean%20cherry-pick%20onto%20main%20eac52f008%3A%20identical%20patch%3B%20refreshed%20frozen-lockfile%20dependencies%2C%20133%20focused%20tests%2C%20server%20typecheck%20and%20format%20check%20passed%20again.%20UI%20diagnostic%20was%20NOT%20rerun%20on%20this%20head%3B%20desktop%2FSEA%20remain%20unproven.%0A",
